Set 300 years in the future, Star Trek is far enough away in time that the writers of the show could create ingenious ideas of travel, entertainment, and communication.

7
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:41,680
After all, it was only 130 years ago that electricity became a reality, turning darkness into light.

8
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,940
